    "message": "Render installed toilets from the shared generated Scenario\n\nThe rendering tests built their own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder\n(20 evacuees, six hours, seed 0) instead of the Scenario the UI makes.\nTheir module fixture now copies the shared generated preview (#88).\nAll five tests run the timeline, so the file stays whole under\ntests/integration; the path to the static files follows the move.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
